== C. CLI: 300 reads = 20 nt + 49-nt adapter with exactly 1 substitution + 30 nt; `-e 1` vs `-e 1.0000001` vs `-e 2`
   -e 1                   : reads trimmed 8/300 (a trimmed read is 20 nt long: 0)
   -e 1.0000001           : reads trimmed 300/300 (a trimmed read is 20 nt long: 300)
   -e 2                   : reads trimmed 300/300 (a trimmed read is 20 nt long: 300)
   -e 0.0204081632653062  : reads trimmed 300/300 (a trimmed read is 20 nt long: 300)
